<title>UK: TABLE - Racal profits slide in year.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Racal profits slide in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (adjusted) 16.19		  vs 15.73</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.9		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.0		    vs 6.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     40.4		   vs 70.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.18 bln	     vs 1.06 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 35.0 and 42.8 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Racal Electronics Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
